{"3544130":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Soul Chained","steam_appid":3544130,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h1>Join our Community<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3544130\/extras\/a5f231c101bcfcc5068056dcd105de6d.avif?t=1789489864\" width=1560 height=390 \/><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Soul Chained is a <strong>solo dev passion project<\/strong> where you and your friends play (and fail) as fallen rival warlords whose souls have been chained together for all eternity.<\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Condemned to wander Purgatory, you must atone for your mortal sins while bound to the very people you once called enemies. The Soul Chain is the center of it all - be it combat, exploration, demise, or victory.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you get:<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeet enemies (or friends) using chaotic chain-physics-based combat<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain Magic, Various Weaponry and Stat Progression<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique bosses and enemy encounters<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go crazy with up to 4 players in Online Havoc Mode for maximum jank and chaos<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bad Graphics &amp; Equal Opportunity Jiggle Physics<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Jank slider that does absolutely nothing, I promise<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3544130\/extras\/6fe9493f5655d879df021a58182be56c.poster.avif?t=1789489864\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3544130\/extras\/6fe9493f5655d879df021a58182be56c.webm?t=1789489864\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3544130\/extras\/6fe9493f5655d879df021a58182be56c.mp4?t=1789489864\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Soul Chain is neither your friend nor your enemy.<\/strong> Sometimes it creates the most cinematic coordinated attacks imaginable. Other times, it tugs you and your teammate straight into chaos as you die together in frustration.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coil and tie up enemies together, trip bosses, slingshot objects, clothesline groups of mobs... and more.<\/strong> Combat is deliberate, stamina matters, and <strong>panic rolling<\/strong> is a lifestyle I actively designed against. Remember - learning how to fight with the Soul Chain IS the entire game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3544130\/extras\/4956469c86415017c51d7d22b1edd4ef.poster.avif?t=1789489864\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3544130\/extras\/4956469c86415017c51d7d22b1edd4ef.webm?t=1789489864\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3544130\/extras\/4956469c86415017c51d7d22b1edd4ef.mp4?t=1789489864\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you ascend the colossal Tower of Purgatory, <strong>every chapter ends in a battle with massive manifestations of sin, trauma, regret<\/strong>, or an idea I probably came up with far too late at night.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some will crush you. Others will throw you off ledges. All of them hit HARD.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3544130\/extras\/5d10dc31b225ce63112103bf3f788273.poster.avif?t=1789489864\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3544130\/extras\/5d10dc31b225ce63112103bf3f788273.webm?t=1789489864\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3544130\/extras\/5d10dc31b225ce63112103bf3f788273.mp4?t=1789489864\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you want to hate your friends? <\/strong>Bring up to three and ascend the Tower and Purgatory as a group<strong>.<\/strong> You might think - “The more, the better!”, but it usually ends in <strong>more accidental chain yanking, more desperate revives, increasingly louder comms, and failing together as one<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3544130\/extras\/1f7ac014f89ce6c59d72aa5d0dcab53c.poster.avif?t=1789489864\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3544130\/extras\/1f7ac014f89ce6c59d72aa5d0dcab53c.webm?t=1789489864\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3544130\/extras\/1f7ac014f89ce6c59d72aa5d0dcab53c.mp4?t=1789489864\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you a masochist? There's a single-player mode too.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of being chained to a friend, it’s now a <strong>massive glowing ball you'll drag, swing, fight, and fail<\/strong> with throughout your ascension from Purgatory.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Soul Chained is a <strong>solo dev passion project<\/strong> where you and your friends play (and fail) as fallen rival warlords whose souls have been chained together for all eternity.<\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Condemned to wander Purgatory, you must atone for your mortal sins while bound to the very people you once called enemies. The Soul Chain is the center of it all - be it combat, exploration, demise, or victory.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you get:<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeet enemies (or friends) using chaotic chain-physics-based combat<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain Magic, Various Weaponry and Stat Progression<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique bosses and enemy encounters<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go crazy with up to 4 players in Online Havoc Mode for maximum jank and chaos<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bad Graphics &amp; Equal Opportunity Jiggle Physics<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Jank slider that does absolutely nothing, I promise<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3544130\/extras\/6fe9493f5655d879df021a58182be56c.poster.a